<Slide
  style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#FFFFFF', padding: 60, position: 'relative', fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei' }}
  notes={`整个策略只有三条规则，一个月只做三件事：看一次波动、算一个比例、下一个单。\n第一层收益，40% 红利低波。选它的理由不是涨得好，是收益来源不同——股息是不需要有人接盘就能拿到的现金流。\n第二层防御，60% 五年国债。它和权益对同一个宏观变量做相反暴露，股灾里是少数能涨的资产。\n第三层风控，组合近 60 个交易日的实际波动超过年化 8% 时，按 8% 除以实际波动的比例收缩权益，最低到 20%，回落自动恢复。\n执行层：月末判断，次日开盘成交，双边万分之二。八年累计换手 5.5 倍，手续费一共 0.11%。`}
>
  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 0, left: 0, width: 1280, height: 6, background: '#1A3D6D' }} />
  <Text style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 22, right: 60, fontSize: 18, color: '#8B97A8' }}>02 策略设计</Text>

  <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>
    三条规则，一个月操作一次
  </Text>
  <Box style={{ width: 1160, height: 1, background: '#D6DCE5', marginTop: 16 }} />

  <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 16, marginTop: 30 }}>
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', height: 106, alignItems: 'center' }}>
      <Box style={{ width: 128, alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center', height: 106, background: '#1A3D6D' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>收益层</Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', paddingLeft: 24, width: 480 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>40% 红利低波 ETF（512890）</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568', marginTop: 6 }}>钱从哪来</Text>
      </Box>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#4A5568', width: 440, lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
        股息不需要有人接盘就能拿到；2015 年以来全收益指数年化 9.1%
      </Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', height: 106, alignItems: 'center' }}>
      <Box style={{ width: 128, alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center', height: 106, background: '#1A3D6D' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>防御层</Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', paddingLeft: 24, width: 480 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>60% 五年国债 ETF（511010）</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568', marginTop: 6 }}>波动从哪压</Text>
      </Box>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#4A5568', width: 440, lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
        与权益负相关；红利单日跌超 1% 的 206 天里，十年国债平均涨 0.067%
      </Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', height: 106, alignItems: 'center' }}>
      <Box style={{ width: 128, alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center', height: 106, background: '#8B2E2E' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>风控层</Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', paddingLeft: 24, width: 480 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>波动偏离 8% 就调整权益</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568', marginTop: 6 }}>超出预算怎么办</Text>
      </Box>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#4A5568', width: 440, lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
        近 60 日波动 &gt; 8% 按比例收缩、&lt; 8% 按缺口加仓，区间 20%–50%
      </Text>
    </Box>
  </Box>

  <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', background: '#E8EFF8', marginTop: 22, padding: 18, alignItems: 'center', gap: 26 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A3D6D', width: 84 }}>执行层</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1A2230' }}>月末判断</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568' }}>·</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1A2230' }}>次日开盘成交</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568' }}>·</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1A2230' }}>双边万 2</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568' }}>·</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1A2230' }}>月均调整 6.3 个百分点</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>
